{%- set tinyBrainEventSchema = true -%}
{%- include "_includes/events-xml-schema.njk" %}
{%- include "_includes/events-xml-context.njk" %}
<task>
Extract events from the {{ tinyBrainEventSectionLabel }} prose section through the category checkpoints below. This prose is already assigned to its correct movement phase; do not invent player movement, character travel, arrival markers, or travel time outside the explicitly allowed tags for a checkpoint.

At every checkpoint:
- Use only facts from this prose section plus the supplied game context.
- Return exactly one `<events>...</events>` XML block containing all qualifying events for that category. When there are none, return exactly `<events><done/></events>`.
- Use only the explicitly allowed top-level tags. Follow their full schema above exactly.
- A tag is required only when the current checkpoint explicitly lists it under "Required top-level tags." In particular, do not emit `<inCombat>` or `<anyQuestObjectivesCompleted>` before that checkpoint.
- Output no commentary and no markdown fences.
</task>

{% if tinyBrainAcceptedEventXml %}
The following event XML was already accepted from earlier prose sections in this same turn. Use it as context for this section. Still emit every checkpoint-required state tag for the current section, even when an earlier section emitted the same state tag:
<acceptedSectionEvents>
{{ tinyBrainAcceptedEventXml }}
</acceptedSectionEvents>
{% endif %}

{% for stage in tinyBrainEventStages %}
Check the {{ tinyBrainEventSectionLabel }} prose for {{ stage.label }} events.

{{ stage.instructions }}

{# If this location is heuristially determined to be an exterior: #}
{% if currentLocation.isExterior | default(false) %}
IMPORTANT NOTE: This is an exterior location. Before counting any events, make sure the events aren't actually occurring *inside* the building, as that's not the current location and therefore not relevant to this checkpoint. If the prose doesn't make it clear whether the events are inside or outside, assume they are outside. As a rule, if the events are described as being seen through a window or door, do not count them here.
{% endif %}
{# end if #}

Allowed top-level tags for this checkpoint: {{ stage.allowedTagList }}{% if stage.allowRegisteredXmlEvents %}, plus any registered mod-event tags documented in the schema above{% endif %}.
{% if stage.requiredTags and stage.requiredTags | length %}Required top-level tags for this checkpoint (include them even when their value is false): {{ stage.requiredTags | join(', ') }}.
{% endif %}

Return one `<events>...</events>` block with every qualifying event for this checkpoint. If there are none, return exactly `<events><done/></events>`. Output XML only.

{% llmparse('event_xml_stage', tinyBrainEventSectionKind, stage.id, stage.allowedTags, stage.requiredTags, stage.allowRegisteredXmlEvents, eventCheckHiddenNpcNames) %}
{% endfor %}
{% llmresult('event_xml_result') %}
